and it's almost like,

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.158 align:start size:97% position:3%
I'm not saying I've got
magical powers or anything,

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:28.728 align:start size:84% position:16%
but it is that thing
of how can you...

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:30.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
