00:23:50.162 --> 00:23:51.630
That's up to them,
it's not an issue.

00:23:51.630 --> 00:23:53.732 align:start size:81% position:19%
But why is that
correlation there?

00:23:53.732 --> 00:23:55.734
You have a theory, I don't
