00:23:59.404 --> 00:24:00.939
- Someone did say that.
- Someone said that.

00:24:00.939 --> 00:24:02.774
I think there's something to
that, you know what I mean?

00:24:02.774 --> 00:24:04.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
They start becoming
everything that they hate.

00:24:04.776 --> 00:24:07.946
- Well, they're not doing
themselves any favors.

00:24:07.946 --> 00:24:09.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the thing, it's
because I think you and I,

00:24:09.381 --> 00:24:13.018
