00:24:54.493 --> 00:24:56.828
Because it is that ludicrous.

00:24:56.828 --> 00:24:58.897 align:start size:97% position:3%
- But isn't that the irony,
that they're the ones

00:24:58.897 --> 00:25:01.566 align:start size:88% position:13%
