00:25:01.566 --> 00:25:03.034 align:start size:72% position:28%
- Right.
- So, right.

00:25:03.034 --> 00:25:05.070
Nobody in their right mind,
no clear thinking person

00:25:05.070 --> 00:25:07.906 align:start size:88% position:13%
ever thought the rainbow
flag in and of itself

00:25:07.906 --> 00:25:09.207 align:start size:84% position:16%
was excluding anybody.
- Right.

00:25:09.207 --> 00:25:11.176 align:start size:84% position:16%
- The point was you're
gay or something,

00:25:11.176 --> 00:25:12.911
bi, whatever the hell you are,

00:25:12.911 --> 00:25:15.347 align:start size:84% position:16%
go to the parade,
zip-a-dee-damn-do-dah.

00:25:15.347 --> 00:25:16.882
And they're the ones that say

00:25:16.882 --> 00:25:19.184 align:start size:84% position:16%
