00:25:41.773 --> 00:25:44.643
I think it's a new kind
of racialized thinking,

00:25:45.644 --> 00:25:46.945
which isn't helpful.

00:25:46.945 --> 00:25:49.014
It means that you're hyper...

00:25:49.014 --> 00:25:52.350
I mean, being aware of racial
