00:25:58.056 --> 00:25:59.591
I know what you're saying,

00:25:59.591 --> 00:26:01.927
you don't wanna push that
last moment to go from...

00:26:01.927 --> 00:26:03.828
You're trying to give them
the benefit of the doubt

00:26:03.828 --> 00:26:06.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
that it's not racist, it's
not evilly intentioned.

00:26:06.264 --> 00:26:09.167
- No, because I think racism
has to be about intention.

00:26:10.769 --> 00:26:13.271
I get why you'd want
to call it racist,

00:26:13.271 --> 00:26:15.040 align:start size:84% position:16%
but I think because
it is about intention,

00:26:15.040 --> 00:26:17.776
I would step back from that.

00:26:17.776 --> 00:26:20.078 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think they genuinely
believe what they're saying.

00:26:20.946 --> 00:26:22.180
- You think all of them do?

00:26:22.180 --> 00:26:24.082
This has come up with
