woke ideas going on

00:29:39.244 --> 00:29:40.845 align:start size:84% position:16%
and sort of driving
the narrative.

00:29:40.845 --> 00:29:42.580 align:start size:88% position:13%
So, that's what happened
with Labour I think.

00:29:42.580 --> 00:29:44.949 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think the other big thing
with Labour was Brexit.

00:29:44.949 --> 00:29:47.819
So, Brexit became
a sort of linchpin

00:29:47.819 --> 00:29:50.088
for the woke mob to latch onto,

00:29:50.088 --> 00:29:51.523
and what they did is they
do what they always do,

00:29:51.523 --> 00:29:52.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
they turned it into
something it didn't mean.

00:29:52.957 --> 00:29:54.459
So they said, "The
Brexit vote is about

00:29:54.459 --> 00:29:56.094
