00:29:59.898 --> 00:30:03.535 align:start size:97% position:3%
in a neoliberal trading block,
that's what it really was.

00:30:03.535 --> 00:30:04.969
But that's not what
the debate was about.

00:30:04.969 --> 00:30:07.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, it got misinterpreted
and misconstrued,

00:30:07.539 --> 00:30:10.608
and then the Labour Party,
when they ran this time,

00:30:10.608 --> 00:30:12.243 align:start size:97% position:3%
said they were gonna
support a second referendum

00:30:12.243 --> 00:30:14.279 align:start size:84% position:16%
to try and undo
what just happened.

00:30:14.279 --> 00:30:16.014 align:start size:88% position:13%
That kind of
authoritarian instinct,

00:30:16.014 --> 00:30:18.750 align:start size:97% position:3%
rerunning a referendum, saying
the people got it wrong,

00:30:18.750 --> 00:30:22.220 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
that's woke 1.0, that's
straight, that's right there.

00:30:22.220 --> 00:30:23.488 line:0%
- But at the end of the day,

00:30:23.488 --> 00:30:26.124 line:0%
is it because they
don't really care

00:30:26.124 --> 00:30:27.592 line:0%
sort of about what's right?

00:30:27.592 --> 00:30:29.227 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
Like in a way, they don't
care about democracy,

00:30:29.227 --> 00:30:32.063
they don't care about that
the people voted for Brexit.

00:30:32.063 --> 00:30:34.499
They care that they
have enough power

00:30:34.499 --> 00:30:37.635
to use as a cudgel over the
people to get what they want.

00:30:37.635 --> 00:30:39.337
- I think again, there's a
lot of well-meaning people

00:30:39.337 --> 00:30:40.805
in the Labour Party.

00:30:40.805 --> 00:30:44.008 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think again, I think
they've convinced themselves

00:30:44.008 --> 00:30:46.010
through a process over
the last three years

00:30:46.010 --> 00:30:48.446
that the people didn't know
what they were voting for.

00:30:48.446 --> 00:30:51.749
So when I spoke to a member
of Corbyn's Shadow Cabinet

00:30:51.749 --> 00:30:54.819
just after the election, so
just after the Brexit vote

00:30:54.819 --> 00:30:56.120
